      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=130%><b><color=#ffd970>AREA 1 - MATERIALS</color></b></size>

    A
    potter''s workshop where every object demonstrates one <b>URP Lit material</b>
    setting: Smoothness, Metallic, Transparency, Emission and Texture Tiling.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY
    THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1. Change PW_Clay_Glazed''s Smoothness to 0.2
    - which vase does it now match?

    2. Make a new material that looks like polished
    silver.

    3. Change the floor''s Tiling to 2 x 2. What happens to the tiles?</size>'
